[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0010","text":"────那么，排练的日程和流程就是这样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0020","text":"大概都说明了一遍，\n有什么想问的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0030","text":"没什么……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0040","text":"嘛，如果之后还有什么不明白的\n随时来问就行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0050","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0060","text":"路加——————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0070","text":"羽那和阳希，都在很积极地练习"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0080","text":"各自都在以自己的方式，虽然只是一点一点地……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0090","text":"……谁问你这个了\n没事了就滚吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0100","text":"啊啊，那我先走了\n回头再联系"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0102","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0109","text":"咖啡店客人１"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0110","text":"今天营业部带来的那个\n治具的样品你看了吗────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0119","text":"咖啡店客人２"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0120","text":"看了看了～，就是那个不知道哪家公司做的吧？\n那个可不行啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0129","text":"咖啡店客人１"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0130","text":"又粗糙又难看\n是外行人做的吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0139","text":"咖啡店客人２"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0140","text":"哈哈哈！　懂懂懂\n听说是手工做的，那种东西拿来卖可受不了啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0150","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0160","text":"吵死了────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0170","text":"……CoMETIK，\n在一点点前进着呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_03260000_04_0180","text":"路加——————"}]
